==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|de}} ''[[simile]]'' "similar": from a standardized bureaucratic form in monarchistic Austria called ''simile''. Nowadays understood to mean ''Schimmel'' "white horse".

===Noun===
{{de-noun-m-unc|genitive=Amtsschimmels}}

# A surplus of bureaucracy, [[red tape]].

====Homophones====
* [[Schimmel]] (mold)
* [[Schimmel]] (horse)

